   "sourceHash": "f613ddcadad2895d13a4cb7f99f3c52282ff202074482f2808004c71d8a73bbb",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]◆[[CLOSE_1]][[OPEN_2]]Balans tussen lichaam en geest na competitieve belasting[[CLOSE_2]]",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
